        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "That sentence is only four words shorter than the first, but it is not ungainly. So it can't be length alone that makes a long sentence difficult. In this lesson, we focus on how to write longer sentences that are also clear and shapely.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                117,
                784,
                193
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    117.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    193.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    193.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Readers get a sense of shapeless length from four things:",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                195,
                610,
                220
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    127.0,
                    195.0
                ],
                [
                    610.0,
                    195.0
                ],
                [
                    610.0,
                    220.0
                ],
                [
                    127.0,
                    220.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• They don’t find a sentence’s point near its beginning.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                239,
                601,
                263
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    239.0
                ],
                [
                    601.0,
                    239.0
                ],
                [
                    601.0,
                    263.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    263.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• They have to wait too long to get to the verb in the main clause.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                270,
                687,
                295
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    270.0
                ],
                [
                    687.0,
                    270.0
                ],
                [
                    687.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    295.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- After the verb, they have to slog through a series of tacked-on phrases and dependent clauses.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                303,
                782,
                353
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    353.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    353.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• They are stopped by one interruption after another.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                361,
                585,
                386
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
